{
  "slug": "commit-commands",
  "name": "Commit Commands",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Commands for git commit workflows including commit, push, and PR creation",
  "longDescription": "Adds 3 slash commands for git workflow: `/commit` stages changes and generates a commit message, `/commit-push-pr` commits, pushes, and opens a PR in one step, and `/clean_gone` prunes local branches whose remote tracking branches have been deleted. Reduces multi-step git operations to single commands.",
